#           declared interval -> never fresh -> silence, never a lie).  037.
#   module  the per-metric GUIDELINE -- a recommended cadence and WHY.  That
#           is domain knowledge, so it lives HERE in module code, exactly like
#           _MEAL_MEASURES above.  It is never seeded as data: a migration
#           that minted an interval would freeze a guess (037's own rule).
#   user    the confirmed value.  Picks after seeing the guideline; what the
