    "CAPTURE_REPLY All assistant text is owner-visible. Write NO text before "
    "or between tool calls, including retries, id explanations or corrections. "
    "Keep working notes internal. The first numeric field above is the "
    "experience id; reuse it silently for every facet. Finish all tool work "
    "and the planned-task evidence check before ONE final reply. "
    "Eaten food keeps meal-log/meal-add's real meal card and printed satiety "
